# Snapchat Web — agent rails

This repo also has `anybuddyapp.com/`. Do **not** apply Snapchat-only constraints to Anybuddy.

## Safety
- Dedicated Snapchat **test** account only — never a personal account.
- Low rate: sequential runs, short delays; no parallel spam.
- No mass DMs, friend farming, Story/Spotlight blasting.
- Catalog scripts stay **read-only** (no Send). One-off Send / Story / Lens probes are OK only when the user explicitly asks; prefer `exec_code`, do not promote auto-Send scripts.
- Ban risk: see `web.snapchat.com/docs/BAN_RISKS.md` and `SCOPE.md`.

## Catalog vs exploration
- Shipped digests: `check_session`, `list_chats`, `open_chat`, `list_chat_messages` under `web.snapchat.com/`.
- Hard stops (gallery→Story, Lenses, quotas): `web.snapchat.com/docs/LIMITATIONS.md`.
- Host UI only (`www.snapchat.com/web/`) — no unofficial APIs, no mobile automation.

## Language (take-home deliverables)
- English for code, meta, tests, docs.
- French for Loom narration and the submission email only.

## Habits
- Log friction in `web.snapchat.com/docs/QA.md` as you hit it.
- Discover with `start_session` + `exec_code`; ship with draft → test → promote.
- Auth/session failures are P0 — document and fix; do not fake success.
